      "Language": "por",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Total chronic occlusion of the left main coronary artery is an unusual finding. After a review of the literature, the authors present a case report of a patient with stable angina and total occlusion of the left main coronary artery, right coronary with atherosclerotic lesions and normal ventricular function."},
